### Get user by ID
### ⚠️ Note: Currently authentication is not enforced (permitAll), but token is included for future use
GET http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### If token variable is not set, manually set it:
### @token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
### Or run the login.http request first to automatically set the token

### Example Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "userId": 1,
###     "email": "user@example.com",
###     "username": "testuser",
###     "isVerified": false,
###     "kycCompleted": false,
###     "isActive": true,
###     "isBlocked": false
###   },
###   "timestamp": "2025-11-25T04:30:00"
### }
